  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"dcf60125\" id=\"dcf60125\"><span data-lake-id=\"uefb8bc6a\" id=\"uefb8bc6a\">课程名称：从大模型到具身智能：原理与仿真实践 </span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u10f4fa88\" id=\"u10f4fa88\"><br></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22HzEeS%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"dfaac179\" id=\"dfaac179\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubc8018ca\" id=\"ubc8018ca\">第一部分：告别“无身”AI——什么是具身智能？ </span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"efc90b19\" id=\"efc90b19\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucc0b3a1f\" id=\"ucc0b3a1f\">1.1 熟悉的AI vs. 机器人 </span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u2f369b47\" id=\"u2f369b47\"><span data-lake-id=\"u312e3349\" id=\"u312e3349\">我们日常接触的AI（大语言模型、图像识别）通常是“无身”的（Disembodied）。</span></p><ul list=\"u2f04484f\"><li fid=\"uee65bc3c\" data-lake-id=\"u0fcd616d\" id=\"u0fcd616d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud44537e7\" id=\"ud44537e7\">图像识别</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uccbc6bc2\" id=\"uccbc6bc2\">：输入是像素矩阵，输出是类别标签。</span></li><li fid=\"uee65bc3c\" data-lake-id=\"u057a96ee\" id=\"u057a96ee\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u113953ea\" id=\"u113953ea\">大语言模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u36f6bee4\" id=\"u36f6bee4\">：输入是Token序列，输出是Token序列。</span></li><li fid=\"uee65bc3c\" data-lake-id=\"u7760fb04\" id=\"u7760fb04\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7dedfa44\" id=\"u7dedfa44\">特点</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8fd25d30\" id=\"u8fd25d30\">：它们不需要承受重力、摩擦或碰撞。即便输出错误（幻觉），也不会导致机器物理损坏。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"960341b0\" id=\"960341b0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua395eaeb\" id=\"ua395eaeb\">1.2 机器人的因果链 </span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u89e03460\" id=\"u89e03460\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3d606796\" id=\"u3d606796\">机器人引入了物理因果：</span></p><ul list=\"u7d97bd02\"><li fid=\"u2a582ffd\" data-lake-id=\"u87726965\" id=\"u87726965\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uda6da562\" id=\"uda6da562\">语言模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u61b1d933\" id=\"u61b1d933\">：文字 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u77f51ed9\" id=\"u77f51ed9\">→</span><span data-lake-id=\"u179bef3d\" id=\"u179bef3d\"> 模型 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u6de62c39\" id=\"u6de62c39\">→</span><span data-lake-id=\"ue8c01b67\" id=\"ue8c01b67\"> 文字</span></li><li fid=\"u2a582ffd\" data-lake-id=\"u4a12b030\" id=\"u4a12b030\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7963a50c\" id=\"u7963a50c\">机器人</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf27c645e\" id=\"uf27c645e\">：传感器 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u587e9803\" id=\"u587e9803\">→</span><span data-lake-id=\"u029252b3\" id=\"u029252b3\"> 决策 </span><span data-lake-id=\"ucc15cc0e\" id=\"ucc15cc0e\">→</span><span data-lake-id=\"u39091904\" id=\"u39091904\"> 电机 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u772396fa\" id=\"u772396fa\">→</span><span data-lake-id=\"u1f6ac206\" id=\"u1f6ac206\"> 身体 </span><span data-lake-id=\"ubb6cec4a\" id=\"ubb6cec4a\">→</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub99fffd6\" id=\"ub99fffd6\">环境</span></strong></li><li fid=\"u2a582ffd\" data-lake-id=\"ud4f92f43\" id=\"ud4f92f43\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uebb7e3c5\" id=\"uebb7e3c5\">后果</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub27bd0c0\" id=\"ub27bd0c0\">：如果决策输出错误动作，会导致摔倒、碰撞或硬件烧毁。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"b68b4bbb\" id=\"b68b4bbb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u08d04983\" id=\"u08d04983\">1.3 具身智能的定义 </span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u68b62848\" id=\"u68b62848\"><span data-lake-id=\"u478488f6\" id=\"u478488f6\">具身智能（Embodied AI）不仅仅是大脑，它包含五个不可分割的部分：</span></p><ol list=\"u33650cdd\"><li fid=\"udd20dad0\" data-lake-id=\"ud231aefe\" id=\"ud231aefe\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5ca92c55\" id=\"u5ca92c55\">身体（Body）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5bd70591\" id=\"u5bd70591\">：机械结构、连杆、关节。</span></li><li fid=\"udd20dad0\" data-lake-id=\"uaf5774c1\" id=\"uaf5774c1\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u26468162\" id=\"u26468162\">环境（Environment）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u19ccdab9\" id=\"u19ccdab9\">：地面摩擦系数、障碍物、重力场。</span></li><li fid=\"udd20dad0\" data-lake-id=\"ua010b671\" id=\"ua010b671\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6a26acad\" id=\"u6a26acad\">感知（Perception）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7853e50c\" id=\"u7853e50c\">：关节编码器（位置）、IMU（姿态/加速度）、相机、触觉传感器。</span></li><li fid=\"udd20dad0\" data-lake-id=\"u3ffa95ea\" id=\"u3ffa95ea\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u038817cc\" id=\"u038817cc\">决策（Decision）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4ead253b\" id=\"u4ead253b\">：规则（Rule-based）、控制器（Controller）、神经网络策略（Policy Network）。</span></li><li fid=\"udd20dad0\" data-lake-id=\"uad364a81\" id=\"uad364a81\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0d800039\" id=\"u0d800039\">行动（Action）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubbad877b\" id=\"ubbad877b\">：电机扭矩、舵机角度、轮子转速。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u5d233d72\" id=\"u5d233d72\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaa086572\" id=\"uaa086572\">核心洞察</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u264c904d\" id=\"u264c904d\">：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6fbcb803\" id=\"u6fbcb803\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0239e151\" id=\"u0239e151\">智能不只存在于“大脑”中。</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u43fa2d25\" id=\"u43fa2d25\">身体形态</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0d46da38\" id=\"u0d46da38\">（腿长、脚掌大小）、</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue9c7f887\" id=\"ue9c7f887\">关节结构</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud41fe5c0\" id=\"ud41fe5c0\">（自由度配置）和</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1ffe003a\" id=\"u1ffe003a\">环境约束</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua5799797\" id=\"ua5799797\">（重力）共同参与了行为的形成。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u62e109d2\" id=\"u62e109d2\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u11822a7b\" id=\"u11822a7b\">例如：脚掌太小、质心太高或电机扭矩不足，再好的算法也无法让机器人稳定行走。</span></em></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JHEw0%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"18a00a0d\" id=\"18a00a0d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u02207179\" id=\"u02207179\">第二部分：感知—决策—行动闭环 </span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"5c84d619\" id=\"5c84d619\"><span data-lake-id=\"u90a6021d\" id=\"u90a6021d\">2.1 闭环控制循环 </span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u435f19af\" id=\"u435f19af\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0ef3e33a\" id=\"u0ef3e33a\">机器人的运行是一个高频循环过程：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96%E8%BA%AB%E4%BD%93%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%20(State)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E2%86%93%5Cn%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%20(%E5%A6%82%EF%BC%9A%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%80%BE%E6%96%9C%EF%BC%9F%E9%80%9F%E5%BA%A6%E5%A4%9A%E5%A4%A7%EF%BC%9F)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E2%86%93%5Cn%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%85%B3%E8%8A%82%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%20(Control%20Command)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E2%86%93%5Cn%E7%94%B5%E6%9C%BA%E5%B8%A6%E5%8A%A8%E8%BA%AB%E4%BD%93%E8%BF%90%E5%8A%A8%20(Actuation)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E2%86%93%5Cn%E8%BA%AB%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%8E%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E4%BA%A4%E4%BA%92%20(Physics%3A%20%E7%A2%B0%E6%92%9E%E3%80%81%E6%91%A9%E6%93%A6)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E2%86%93%5Cn%5B%E5%9B%9E%E5%88%B0%E8%B5%B7%E7%82%B9%5D%20%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E8%BA%AB%E4%BD%93%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x8nvg%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"d48bf095\" id=\"d48bf095\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0df868d9\" id=\"u0df868d9\">2.2 开环 vs. 闭环 </span></h3><ul list=\"uc944129e\"><li fid=\"u3978d3cd\" data-lake-id=\"uc8d0c3ae\" id=\"uc8d0c3ae\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8245002f\" id=\"u8245002f\">开环控制 (Open-Loop)</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubd4fbd2f\" id=\"ubd4fbd2f\">：</span></li></ul><ul list=\"uc944129e\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ub25d9d4a\" data-lake-id=\"u9b7bd2c8\" id=\"u9b7bd2c8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucd63cd7c\" id=\"ucd63cd7c\">提前写好动作序列（如：抬腿30度，停顿0.5秒，落下）。</span></li><li fid=\"ub25d9d4a\" data-lake-id=\"ub9a4974a\" id=\"ub9a4974a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6792d32a\" id=\"u6792d32a\">执行时不关心实际结果。</span></li><li fid=\"ub25d9d4a\" data-lake-id=\"u6951da93\" id=\"u6951da93\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u5650a955\" id=\"u5650a955\">比喻</span></em><span data-lake-id=\"u8a05e116\" id=\"u8a05e116\">：闭着眼睛沿直线走路，撞墙了也不知道。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"uf0802a24\" id=\"uf0802a24\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u50480657\" id=\"u50480657\"><br></p><ul list=\"uc944129e\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u3978d3cd\" data-lake-id=\"u97eaeeac\" id=\"u97eaeeac\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucf1af645\" id=\"ucf1af645\">闭环控制 (Closed-Loop)</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud58cabcd\" id=\"ud58cabcd\">：</span></li></ul><ul list=\"uc944129e\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u60e185d7\" data-lake-id=\"uc2ed14d1\" id=\"uc2ed14d1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1cfaf800\" id=\"u1cfaf800\">每一帧根据实际状态反馈修正动作。</span></li><li fid=\"u60e185d7\" data-lake-id=\"uc22e45d9\" id=\"uc22e45d9\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u4d6139e1\" id=\"u4d6139e1\">比喻</span></em><span data-lake-id=\"ue10ee916\" id=\"ue10ee916\">：睁着眼睛走，看到偏左就往右修。</span></li><li fid=\"u60e185d7\" data-lake-id=\"ub07406f6\" id=\"ub07406f6\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u371454ad\" id=\"u371454ad\">必要性</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7ada7465\" id=\"u7ada7465\">：机器人必须依赖闭环控制来抵抗扰动（如被推了一下）。</span></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22EdFmY%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"b749efa0\" id=\"b749efa0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u81dcf931\" id=\"u81dcf931\">第三部分：具身智能系统的层次结构 </span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"udb2e58d8\" id=\"udb2e58d8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7554eb53\" id=\"u7554eb53\">我们可以将复杂的控制系统分为三层：</span></p><ol list=\"uf3a0a7d7\"><li fid=\"uc9517d37\" data-lake-id=\"udb5783fe\" id=\"udb5783fe\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6282e270\" id=\"u6282e270\">任务层 (Task Layer)</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u833c5196\" id=\"u833c5196\">：</span></li></ol><ul list=\"ufc68e4f4\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ud7180c63\" data-lake-id=\"ufdb64840\" id=\"ufdb64840\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u2d905c72\" id=\"u2d905c72\">目标</span></em><span data-lake-id=\"u4123d7fe\" id=\"u4123d7fe\">：“向前走”、“左转90度”、“停下来”。</span></li><li fid=\"ud7180c63\" data-lake-id=\"u9df0c497\" id=\"u9df0c497\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1bde7d40\" id=\"u1bde7d40\">这是人类下达指令的层级。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"uf3a0a7d7\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"uc9517d37\" data-lake-id=\"u2d11b80e\" id=\"u2d11b80e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u56f39e9a\" id=\"u56f39e9a\">规划/策略层 (Planning/Policy Layer)</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u85453d2f\" id=\"u85453d2f\">：</span></li></ol><ul list=\"u20263107\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u13d915fd\" data-lake-id=\"ud54e7f74\" id=\"ud54e7f74\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u056e593e\" id=\"u056e593e\">目标</span></em><span data-lake-id=\"u613a1f92\" id=\"u613a1f92\">：为了实现“向前走”，下一步躯干如何摆动？脚落在哪里？</span></li><li fid=\"u13d915fd\" data-lake-id=\"ub7a2eca1\" id=\"ub7a2eca1\"><span data-lake-id=\"uabd335c1\" id=\"uabd335c1\">对应强化学习中的Policy，或传统控制中的轨迹规划器。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"uf3a0a7d7\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"uc9517d37\" data-lake-id=\"u7ed38798\" id=\"u7ed38798\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u80943db9\" id=\"u80943db9\">底层控制层 (Low-level Control Layer)</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua2470046\" id=\"ua2470046\">：</span></li></ol><ul list=\"u6463a9aa\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u97fa5f05\" data-lake-id=\"uab5928e6\" id=\"uab5928e6\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u262ff50f\" id=\"u262ff50f\">目标</span></em><span data-lake-id=\"u7e1a8bab\" id=\"u7e1a8bab\">：为了达到规划的姿势，膝关节具体转到多少角度？电机输出多大扭矩？</span></li><li fid=\"u97fa5f05\" data-lake-id=\"u43db93d2\" id=\"u43db93d2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubefd4e57\" id=\"ubefd4e57\">对应PID控制器或力矩控制器。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"2ddffb53\" id=\"2ddffb53\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud323f230\" id=\"ud323f230\">3.1 传统方法与学习方法的结合 </span></h3><ul list=\"ucd3e05e3\"><li fid=\"u6c1a4604\" data-lake-id=\"ucd73c292\" id=\"ucd73c292\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5111f30e\" id=\"u5111f30e\">传统方法</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua04114c5\" id=\"ua04114c5\">：工程师手动设计运动学方程、动力学模型和控制律（如PID、MPC）。</span></li><li fid=\"u6c1a4604\" data-lake-id=\"u042e5e38\" id=\"u042e5e38\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub19a2e12\" id=\"ub19a2e12\">学习方法</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua48f207e\" id=\"ua48f207e\">：让策略在仿真中通过试错（如强化学习）学习从观测到动作的映射。</span></li><li fid=\"u6c1a4604\" data-lake-id=\"u8ed990c8\" id=\"u8ed990c8\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2a38eb04\" id=\"u2a38eb04\">现状</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u36ed035b\" id=\"u36ed035b\">：二者并非对立。纯强化学习的步态往往像“咕咕鸡”（姿态丑陋、效率低），通常需要引入</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u34f508b9\" id=\"u34f508b9\">参考动作（Reference Motion）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3d027c71\" id=\"u3d027c71\">或</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6144cbed\" id=\"u6144cbed\">传统控制先验</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1321b234\" id=\"u1321b234\">，才能让机器人走得像人。真实系统中，往往是“学习策略负责高层意图，传统控制负责底层稳定和抗扰”。</span></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22W6I5q%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"b17694fd\" id=\"b17694fd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1e077b52\" id=\"u1e077b52\">第四部分：平衡的物理原理（为什么站着也是技术活？） </span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u9e59583f\" id=\"u9e59583f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufee7647e\" id=\"ufee7647e\">即使人静止站立，身体也在微调。这是因为重力与支撑力的博弈。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u138b4849\" id=\"u138b4849\"><span data-lake-id=\"u65672826\" id=\"u65672826\">单脚站立闭眼，体会肌肉高频微颤，理解“不动之动”。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"6434c53f\" id=\"6434c53f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u51821a31\" id=\"u51821a31\">4.1 质心 (Center of Mass, CoM) </span></h3><ul list=\"ub0d5a3aa\"><li fid=\"u4d6629a3\" data-lake-id=\"uf80ca68a\" id=\"uf80ca68a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub3e2ce59\" id=\"ub3e2ce59\">质心不是几何中心，而是全身质量加权平均的位置。</span></li><li fid=\"u4d6629a3\" data-lake-id=\"ua372a933\" id=\"ua372a933\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1ac7d329\" id=\"u1ac7d329\">重力</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9b3eff32\" id=\"u9b3eff32\">作用于质心，方向竖直向下。</span></li><li fid=\"u4d6629a3\" data-lake-id=\"u360bec50\" id=\"u360bec50\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf266c017\" id=\"uf266c017\">支持力</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaceef791\" id=\"uaceef791\">作用于足底，方向向上。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u3280083a\" id=\"u3280083a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u549b5f19\" id=\"u549b5f19\">​</span><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"20862b15\" id=\"20862b15\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1d164af1\" id=\"u1d164af1\">4.2 质心投影与支撑区域 (Support Polygon) </span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u59484e8c\" id=\"u59484e8c\"><span data-lake-id=\"udc7c0914\" id=\"udc7c0914\">从质心向地面作垂线，得到</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7206dd4b\" id=\"u7206dd4b\">质心投影</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud39541be\" id=\"ud39541be\">。</span></p><ul list=\"u6ffe63c9\"><li fid=\"u4012e70e\" data-lake-id=\"uc7c9da85\" id=\"uc7c9da85\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u183dcb90\" id=\"u183dcb90\">支撑区域</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf326919e\" id=\"uf326919e\">：所有支撑脚与地面接触点构成的凸多边形。</span></li><li fid=\"u4012e70e\" data-lake-id=\"ufdbb7745\" id=\"ufdbb7745\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u86b6ffb4\" id=\"u86b6ffb4\">静态平衡</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue3429ceb\" id=\"ue3429ceb\">：质心投影落在支撑区域内，机器人不易倾倒。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u6ffe63c9\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u0cf74e27\" data-lake-id=\"u51148847\" id=\"u51148847\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"ua72053da\" id=\"ua72053da\">双脚站立</span></em><span data-lake-id=\"u35f64fd9\" id=\"u35f64fd9\">：支撑区域大，稳定。</span></li><li fid=\"u0cf74e27\" data-lake-id=\"u134cb770\" id=\"u134cb770\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"ue6428dff\" id=\"ue6428dff\">单脚站立</span></em><span data-lake-id=\"uee06eb8f\" id=\"uee06eb8f\">：支撑区域缩小为一条线或一个面，极难维持平衡。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u6ffe63c9\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u4012e70e\" data-lake-id=\"uf36a9270\" id=\"uf36a9270\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u05c47c37\" id=\"u05c47c37\">动态考量</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4c73a049\" id=\"u4c73a049\">：高速运动时，不能仅看静态投影，还需考虑惯性力和角动量。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"cfac941d\" id=\"cfac941d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9ffbc18a\" id=\"u9ffbc18a\">4.3 动态平衡：倒立摆与 Capture Point </span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uf50ca5c8\" id=\"uf50ca5c8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6a8f49e5\" id=\"u6a8f49e5\">机器人跌倒往往不是因为位置偏了，而是因为速度太快。</span></p><ul list=\"u1642d3b4\"><li fid=\"u38decab4\" data-lake-id=\"u9325f128\" id=\"u9325f128\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufca0639e\" id=\"ufca0639e\">危险情况</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u38220551\" id=\"u38220551\">：倾角小，但角速度极大（正在快速倒下）。</span></li><li fid=\"u38decab4\" data-lake-id=\"ub101cf15\" id=\"ub101cf15\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1456f090\" id=\"u1456f090\">安全情况</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u856fb4e2\" id=\"u856fb4e2\">：倾角大，但角速度为负（正在回正）。</span></li><li fid=\"u38decab4\" data-lake-id=\"uda5f8e52\" id=\"uda5f8e52\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3d58029f\" id=\"u3d58029f\">Capture Point (捕捉点) 直觉</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1dd062ab\" id=\"u1dd062ab\">：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u003a4ec4\" id=\"u003a4ec4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3f6e8dc2\" id=\"u3f6e8dc2\">如果身体已经有了倾倒速度，脚必须落在质心投影的</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc5659d6d\" id=\"uc5659d6d\">前方</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u21fc4ea3\" id=\"u21fc4ea3\">（速度越快，落点越远），才能像“接球”一样把身体的动能抵消掉。这就是动态步行（Dynamic Walking）的核心思想。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1ccc6d8c\" id=\"u1ccc6d8c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u11d375c7\" id=\"u11d375c7\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u838b9946\" id=\"u838b9946\"><span data-lake-id=\"u31ec9b41\" id=\"u31ec9b41\">01_物理重量质心演示.html</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u754d7c38\" id=\"u754d7c38\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc3c19b7e\" id=\"uc3c19b7e\">​</span><br></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qi91Y%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"e6719dbb\" id=\"e6719dbb\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub046c29f\" id=\"ub046c29f\">第五部分：步态分析——一步一步怎么走？ </span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uc8ae2900\" id=\"uc8ae2900\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6b71ead6\" id=\"u6b71ead6\">以双足机器人为例，一个完整的步态周期包含6个阶段：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc1c7b48d\" id=\"uc1c7b48d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1f31fbea\" id=\"u1f31fbea\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6273fb2c\" id=\"u6273fb2c\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u34cd1c02\" id=\"u34cd1c02\"><span data-lake-id=\"u913c0c78\" id=\"u913c0c78\">​</span><br></p><ol list=\"u5ca2fa6e\"><li fid=\"u337dd042\" data-lake-id=\"uc6466156\" id=\"uc6466156\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u86f827ab\" id=\"u86f827ab\">双脚支撑期 (Double Support)</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub692134a\" id=\"ub692134a\">：两脚着地，准备转移重心。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u24c91b02\" id=\"u24c91b02\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5eba3125\" id=\"u5eba3125\">检查机器人的脚有没有接触地面。</span></p><ol list=\"u5ca2fa6e\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u337dd042\" data-lake-id=\"u6dc8f34e\" id=\"u6dc8f34e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub3b8b8de\" id=\"ub3b8b8de\">重心转移 (Weight Transfer)</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u44cb769a\" id=\"u44cb769a\">：质心移动到支撑脚正上方。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u2ebaa2ff\" id=\"u2ebaa2ff\"><span data-lake-id=\"u71755593\" id=\"u71755593\">考虑身体和支撑脚的位置</span></p><ol list=\"u5ca2fa6e\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u337dd042\" data-lake-id=\"u64847295\" id=\"u64847295\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9c88bb04\" id=\"u9c88bb04\">摆动脚离地 (Toe-off)</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u49eaa608\" id=\"u49eaa608\">：摆动脚脚跟抬起。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u91bf84dc\" id=\"u91bf84dc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u78fd5010\" id=\"u78fd5010\">抬脚的运动学， 正运动学，逆运动学，雅可比矩阵，矩阵伪逆</span></p><ol list=\"u5ca2fa6e\" start=\"4\"><li fid=\"u337dd042\" data-lake-id=\"uf8432d4c\" id=\"uf8432d4c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6d15d905\" id=\"u6d15d905\">摆动腿前摆 (Swing)</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud1b35c7c\" id=\"ud1b35c7c\">：摆动腿向前迈步。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u2d0ace4e\" id=\"u2d0ace4e\"><span data-lake-id=\"udeee1789\" id=\"udeee1789\"> 摔倒预警， 计算落脚点位置。</span></p><ol list=\"u5ca2fa6e\" start=\"5\"><li fid=\"u337dd042\" data-lake-id=\"u702c5617\" id=\"u702c5617\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5def58e9\" id=\"u5def58e9\">脚跟着地 (Heel-strike)</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0cc04682\" id=\"u0cc04682\">：摆动脚接触地面。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u19d57c8e\" id=\"u19d57c8e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubacb4614\" id=\"ubacb4614\">  摆动脚坐标和运动轨迹计算</span></p><ol list=\"u5ca2fa6e\" start=\"6\"><li fid=\"u337dd042\" data-lake-id=\"u759f224e\" id=\"u759f224e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5c3cb6c8\" id=\"u5c3cb6c8\">角色互换</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0e1a5716\" id=\"u0e1a5716\">：原支撑脚变为摆动脚，开始下一个周期。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"uc71be56a\" id=\"uc71be56a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6bb5f61e\" id=\"u6bb5f61e\">  控制流水线</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub9265e87\" id=\"ub9265e87\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufc91a601\" id=\"ufc91a601\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u031041df\" id=\"u031041df\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9b4166ba\" id=\"u9b4166ba\">空间三轴控制</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1099d435\" id=\"u1099d435\">：</span></p><ul list=\"ua6d19401\"><li fid=\"u9013eeb5\" data-lake-id=\"uea2a5786\" id=\"uea2a5786\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0e504a4e\" id=\"u0e504a4e\">X轴 (前进/后退)</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8607052c\" id=\"u8607052c\">：步长控制。</span></li><li fid=\"u9013eeb5\" data-lake-id=\"u6113c0f9\" id=\"u6113c0f9\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u51af3712\" id=\"u51af3712\">Y轴 (左右/侧向)</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u86198dff\" id=\"u86198dff\">：左右腿距离控制（简化模型 先不考虑）。</span></li><li fid=\"u9013eeb5\" data-lake-id=\"ua73d7597\" id=\"ua73d7597\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub805d5d7\" id=\"ub805d5d7\">Z轴 (垂直)</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc5b617ec\" id=\"uc5b617ec\">：抬脚高度（防磕绊）。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u51cb57da\" id=\"u51cb57da\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"2936d22e\" id=\"2936d22e\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf1ecd280\" id=\"uf1ecd280\">MuJoCo 现象演示（常见错误） </span></h3><ol list=\"u9a711e45\"><li fid=\"u967711cb\" data-lake-id=\"uc3f1846b\" id=\"uc3f1846b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9e9fbd13\" id=\"u9e9fbd13\">直接抬脚</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1dd85a48\" id=\"u1dd85a48\">：未转移重心，导致支撑区域瞬间减小，机器人侧翻。</span></li><li fid=\"u967711cb\" data-lake-id=\"u3c4f1210\" id=\"u3c4f1210\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1873d026\" id=\"u1873d026\">先移重心再抬脚</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"udf8bc392\" id=\"udf8bc392\">：正确的启动方式。</span></li><li fid=\"u967711cb\" data-lake-id=\"ub297c87d\" id=\"ub297c87d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uae0000c8\" id=\"uae0000c8\">贴地拖动</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue3b9885d\" id=\"ue3b9885d\">：摆动脚高度不够，与地面摩擦，阻碍前进。</span></li><li fid=\"u967711cb\" data-lake-id=\"ufc1f5e0a\" id=\"ufc1f5e0a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7e8dc3e1\" id=\"u7e8dc3e1\">弧形抬腿</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u864e865c\" id=\"u864e865c\">：模仿人类步态，效率更高，减少撞击地面风险。</span></li></ol><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22hTRX4%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u85882cf6\" id=\"u85882cf6\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u576e9b45\" id=\"u576e9b45\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"3d79db63\" id=\"3d79db63\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9fe062f2\" id=\"u9fe062f2\">第六部分：MuJoCo 仿真入门 </span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"e69cc35d\" id=\"e69cc35d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua1d38594\" id=\"ua1d38594\">6.1 URDF 与 XML </span></h3><ul list=\"u987b75ab\"><li fid=\"u7507e937\" data-lake-id=\"u372a2064\" id=\"u372a2064\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u36087a76\" id=\"u36087a76\">URDF (Unified Robot Description Format)</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2e556736\" id=\"u2e556736\">：XML格式的机器人描述文件。</span></li><li fid=\"u7507e937\" data-lake-id=\"uad1336f7\" id=\"uad1336f7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2ffa38eb\" id=\"u2ffa38eb\">内容</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue0b2d73e\" id=\"ue0b2d73e\">：定义了Link（连杆/质量属性）、Joint（关节/自由度）、Visual（外观）、Collision（碰撞体）以及执行器（Actuator）。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u5c60165e\" id=\"u5c60165e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8fde3eff\" id=\"u8fde3eff\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1377bfab\" id=\"u1377bfab\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba8ef1a3\" id=\"uba8ef1a3\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud380057e\" id=\"ud380057e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue0846bb8\" id=\"ue0846bb8\">​</span><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"2532f768\" id=\"2532f768\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua58f139a\" id=\"ua58f139a\">6.2 仿真器在计算什么？ </span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u6031b3fa\" id=\"u6031b3fa\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1785214742501-702e1570-10da-42b8-9c14-8d62493539c1.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u1c880162-f358-4bfe-ba4e-c947899f158%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ueb4b5109-d74e-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A568.6666870117188%2C%22height%22%3A302%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A251993%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1559%2C%22originHeight%22%3A829%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E5%BA%95%E5%B1%82%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%3A%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%B8%80%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E4%B8%80%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86%E6%8E%A8%E5%8F%91%22%2C%22x%22%3A379%2C%22y%22%3A132%2C%22width%22%3A969%2C%22height%22%3A55%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%A5%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%2C%E5%B0%91%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%A5%E4%B8%8D%E8%A1%8C%2C%E7%94%A8%E6%9B%B4%E7%9F%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%2C%E6%95%99%E4%BC%9A%E6%9B%B4%E5%AE%9E%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A775%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A558%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8E%A8%E8%BF%9B%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%22%2C%22x%22%3A1136%2C%22y%22%3A645%2C%22width%22%3A182%2C%22height%22%3A48%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BE%E5%AE%9A%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A686%2C%22y%22%3A645%2C%22width%22%3A180%2C%22height%22%3A48%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8A%A0%E5%8A%A0%E8%BD%BD%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A227%2C%22y%22%3A646%2C%22width%22%3A184%2C%22height%22%3A47%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%BB%91%E9%A9%AC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%82%B9%22%2C%22x%22%3A1396%2C%22y%22%3A31%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotatio